{"id":"mxenlxo2tg3q9gaw7ne3glrdq","title":"卡尔斯鲁厄理工学院在《物理评论快报》发现量子比特能量可被缺陷回收","originalTitle":"Hidden defects return a qubit's lost energy","summary":"卡尔斯鲁厄理工学院团队在《物理评论快报》发表研究，发现量子比特能量可通过材料缺陷回收。通过连续测量不同频率超导量子比特的量子跃迁行为，建立能量交换模型，并利用电场强度变化识别缺陷特征。该成果为量子计算机抗干扰设计提供了新思路，相关预印本arXiv:2603.11889，DOI:10.1103/j1r2-5ph7。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-hidden-defects-qubit-lost-energy.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T14:20:08.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:38.500Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T16:59:38.500Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表","Nature"],"score":72,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"a8575d5e-b6e2-4815-9ecd-06522edd2869","title":"卡尔斯鲁厄理工学院发现量子比特能量可被缺陷回收"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"a8575d5e-b6e2-4815-9ecd-06522edd2869","title":"卡尔斯鲁厄理工学院发现量子比特能量可被缺陷回收"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fys1O6V9zlWU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}